Subject: [PATCH 03/34] WP07: Job heartbeats, static caching, compression

Conflict resolution: guest/base.html and guest/pin.html. PR 230 archived the ticket-wallet guest UI (guest-ticket.css, ticket.js, the tw classes). Kept main's stylesheets and guest-enhancements.js, dropped the guest-ticket.css and ticket.js lines, kept WP07's ?v= on the favicons and the load_signature_js switch (form and PIN page). tests/test_wp07_cache_heartbeats.py: the guest script order is checked against guest-enhancements.js instead of ticket.js, and the versioned-URL scan skips templates/guest/archive/ (reference copies no route renders).
